                                "sense_id": "c89dd8bb-61b1-3c85-b417-b58d20be3466",
                                "text": "One should use hypoallergenic jewelry made of surgical grade stainless steel, titanium, 14- or 18-karat gold, or niobium, especially for initial piercings."
                            }
                        ]
